# Buttons

Do not hand-roll repeated CTA labels/icons. Use the typed wrappers:

| Component | When | Label | Icon |
|---|---|---|---|
| `CallbackButton` | Opens request modal | Обратный звонок | `phone-call` (start) |
| `CallButton` | `tel:` call | Позвонить | `phone` (start) |
| `RouteButton` | Yandex directions | Маршрут | `navigation` (start) |
| `NavButton` | In-app `to="..."` | slot text | `arrow-right` (end) |

- `AppButton` is the primitive (variants, link/button). Prefer wrappers above for site CTAs.
- Call on mobile only when a «Позвонить» button is used: wrap in `<div class="lg:hidden">` (see phone-display rule).
- Form actions inside `RequestModal` stay as `AppButton` with `send` / `check` icons.
- Icon-only controls (`MobileCallButton`, header phone tile) are exceptions.

```vue
<CallbackButton />
<CallButton :number="phones.service" />
<RouteButton :location="loc" />
<NavButton to="/service" variant="ghost">Все услуги</NavButton>
```
